Hello!

<%= @invited_by_name %> has invited you to join
"<%= @household_name %>" on Roommate OS!

To join your household:

1. Open <%= @join_url %>
2. Sign up or log in to Roommate OS.
3. Click "Join Household".

If the link does not work, enter this invitation code on the join page:
<%= @invite_code %>

Please keep this code private and do not share it
with anyone outside your household.

If you were not expecting this invitation,
you can safely ignore this email.

Happy roommating!
The Roommate OS Team
